Lab 17: Create Authentication and Authorization Policies
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Understand the fundamentals of authentication and authorization in OpenShift Service Mesh
Configure authentication policies to secure workloads using mutual TLS (mTLS)
Implement service-to-service authorization policies using Istio security features
Test and validate authentication and authorization flows between microservices
Troubleshoot common authentication and authorization issues in a service mesh environment
